        /// <item><description><see cref="CSDL.Props.TextureCreateOPENGLES2TextureVNumber">TextureCreateOPENGLES2TextureVNumber</see>: the GLuint texture associated with the V plane of a YUV texture, if you want to wrap an existing texture.</description></item>
