        /// <item><description><see cref="CSDL.Props.RendererWindowPointer">RendererWindowPointer</see>: the window where rendering is displayed, if any</description></item>
        /// <item><description><see cref="CSDL.Props.RendererSurfacePointer">RendererSurfacePointer</see>: the surface where rendering is displayed, if this is a software renderer without a window</description></item>
        /// <item><description><see cref="CSDL.Props.RendererVsyncNumber">RendererVsyncNumber</see>: the current vsync setting</description></item>
        /// <item><description><see cref="CSDL.Props.RendererMaxTextureSizeNumber">RendererMaxTextureSizeNumber</see>: the maximum texture width and height</description></item>
        /// <item><description><see cref="CSDL.Props.RendererTextureFormatsPointer">RendererTextureFormatsPointer</see>: a (const <see cref="CSDL.Video.PixelFormat">PixelFormat</see> *) array of pixel formats, terminated with <see cref="CSDL.Video.PixelFormat.Unknown">Unknown</see>, representing the available texture formats for this renderer.</description></item>
        /// <item><description><see cref="CSDL.Props.RendererTextureWrappingBoolean">RendererTextureWrappingBoolean</see>: true if the renderer supports <see cref="CSDL.Video.TextureAddressMode.Wrap">Wrap</see> on non-power-of-two textures.</description></item>
        /// <item><description><see cref="CSDL.Props.RendererOutputColorspaceNumber">RendererOutputColorspaceNumber</see>: an <see cref="CSDL.Video.Colorspace">Colorspace</see> value describing the colorspace for output to the display, defaults to <see cref="CSDL.Video.Colorspace.SRGB">SRGB</see>.</description></item>
        /// <item><description><see cref="CSDL.Props.RendererHDREnabledBoolean">RendererHDREnabledBoolean</see>: true if the output colorspace is <see cref="CSDL.Video.Colorspace.SRGBLinear">SRGBLinear</see> and the renderer is showing on a display with HDR enabled. This property can change dynamically when <see cref="CSDL.EventType.WindowHDRStateChanged">WindowHDRStateChanged</see> is sent.</description></item>
        /// <item><description><see cref="CSDL.Props.RendererSdrWhitePointFloat">RendererSdrWhitePointFloat</see>: the value of SDR white in the <see cref="CSDL.Video.Colorspace.SRGBLinear">SRGBLinear</see> colorspace. When HDR is enabled, this value is automatically multiplied into the color scale. This property can change dynamically when <see cref="CSDL.EventType.WindowHDRStateChanged">WindowHDRStateChanged</see> is sent.</description></item>
        /// <item><description><see cref="CSDL.Props.RendererHDRHeadroomFloat">RendererHDRHeadroomFloat</see>: the additional high dynamic range that can be displayed, in terms of the SDR white point. When HDR is not enabled, this will be 1.0. This property can change dynamically when <see cref="CSDL.EventType.WindowHDRStateChanged">WindowHDRStateChanged</see> is sent.</description></item>
        /// </list>
        /// <para>With the direct3d renderer:</para>
        /// <list type="bullet">
        /// <item><description><see cref="CSDL.Props.RendererD3D9DevicePointer">RendererD3D9DevicePointer</see>: the IDirect3DDevice9 associated with the renderer</description></item>
        /// </list>
        /// <para>With the direct3d11 renderer:</para>
        /// <list type="bullet">
        /// <item><description><see cref="CSDL.Props.RendererD3D11DevicePointer">RendererD3D11DevicePointer</see>: the ID3D11Device associated with the renderer</description></item>
        /// <item><description><see cref="CSDL.Props.RendererD3D11SwapchainPointer">RendererD3D11SwapchainPointer</see>: the IDXGISwapChain1 associated with the renderer. This may change when the window is resized.</description></item>
        /// </list>
        /// <para>With the direct3d12 renderer:</para>
        /// <list type="bullet">
